  ],
  "clarifying_question": null,
  "summary": "To determine the compressive stiffness of your porous polymer scaffold, you can use the universal mechanical testing system for direct compressive testing. A hybrid rheometer can also provide supplementary viscoelastic data if your scaffold is a soft hydrogel. Additionally, micro-CT would be valuable to characterize the internal pore structure and porosity."
}

